<title>USA: Milwaukee, Wis., $4.525 mln won by Wheat First.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee, Wis., $4.525 mln won by Wheat First.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer Inc. said it won $4.525 million of Milwaukee, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose Taxable bonds, Series H, with a true interest cost of 7.078 percent.</p>
</text>
